I\u2019ve been thinking a lot about why keeping a home can feel so exhausting \u2014 and I don\u2019t think the answer is always that we have too much to do.\n\nI think we\u2019re making too many of the same decisions over and over again.\nOne of the reasons the Clean Mama Routine works is that those decisions are already made.\n\nMonday? Bathrooms.\nSaturday? Sheets and towels.\nI haven\u2019t decided when to wash my sheets in over 20 years. I decided once.\n\nAnd lately I\u2019ve been wondering:\nWhat else in our homes could we decide once?\nMeals. Laundry. Papers. Schedules. Stuff. Family responsibilities.\nYour home gets harder to manage every time you leave something undecided.\nI\u2019m going to be talking about this a lot over the next couple weeks because I think there\u2019s something here for us to discover together.\n\n\u2728Tell me in the comments: what are you tired of having to remember at home?", "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:49:24.000Z", "videoDuration": 12.7, "videoPlayCount": 17774, "likesCount": 134, "commentsCount": 5, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-sea1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/778340505_18620707897038124_2744361251766739197_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ig_cache_key=Mzk2NjY4ODQyMDkxMzgxNDU0MDE4NjIwNzA3ODkxMDM4MTI0.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=zAs0_2gL5qoQ7kNvwHTPbw-&_nc_oc=AdpOO1LHYl5kF1CW7d3b0ZF0Lrt30AIPJNJJcj82wk-sqEEFp6e1z2HJ8RI5TOSYYM0&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=rg56khpvHhsOG4_AmhbxiQ&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQIK_ULSL-PYdsA073YUCmJnShH4U5KhCKa4WM-i1UrHiw&oe=6A9A0E04", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPG5pBPIKjHresqfF4aQH7_qV8RG83GYG5R5ajAMuljxlUCR1WYeXWEFEK37_wgtCHzSNWgEAW_hCnrS6THZbfRD1UxAldNxcQ9IOY.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=eOuylyP46EIQ7kNvwGZMz0c&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncm